      Process_Step: 
        Process_Description: 
The process of developing the ecological USA dataset consisted of several steps: preparing the raw data for model entry; identifying records meeting data quality criteria; identifying records meeting USA candidate criteria; applying USA filter criteria; generating USA boundaries; final USA QA/QC; and preparing the files for delivery to PHMSA. These steps are described in more detail in the general and GIS methodology reports listed in the cross-reference section. Specific or unique processing steps for individual states are outlined in the state appendices, also cited in the cross-reference section.Process_Date: 200101 
