    Overview_Description: 
      Entity_and_Attribute_Overview: 
TYPE= type of USA
SOURCE=Acronym describing the source files from which individual USAs were derived. The accompanying text file 'ecosource.txt' provides additional information related to SOURCE, including the source agency or organization and their Internet address. In general, contact information for state Natural Heritage Program sources can be obtained from <http://www.natureserve.org/nhp/us_programs.htm>. In addition, NatureServe's Network Division, <http://www.natureserve.org/natureservestaff.htm> or phone: 703-908-1800, can be contacted for assistance.
