    Distribution_Liability: 
Any and all data/information from the Pipeline and Hazardous Materials Safety Administration's National Pipeline Mapping System must be treated as DOT proprietary information. Parties using this information must: restrict disclosure of and access to this data/information to persons with official state and local government responsibility; refrain from redistributing the data/information; and refer requests by other persons for such information to the Associate Administrator for Pipeline Safety. Users must also maintain a list of those persons that have been provided access to this information. This information is provided with the understanding that it is not guaranteed to be correct or complete and conclusions drawn from such information are the responsibility of the user.Standard_Order_Process: 
